# SAKG S1 — Extraction Feasibility Probe

> **Write-path notice.** The S-PROBE deliverable path is
> `reviews/spikes/sakg-s1-extraction-probe.md`. This session's capability grants write
> access to `design/` **only**; a write to `reviews/` would be a scope violation and is
> discarded. The artifact is therefore produced in full at
> `design/spikes/sakg-s1-extraction-probe.md`. To satisfy the S-PROBE `accept` block
> verbatim, a session holding `reviews/` write capability must run:
