## §0 Purpose and stance

SAEOS-1 §9/A8 carries the specification's **single largest untested assumption**: that
PAEOS "*produces* all the required artifacts (L06 matrices, L08 design sets, L11
contracts, decision-graph records, scars), but as prose documents." §10/D7 ratified S1 as
"explicitly a falsification test." This probe attempts to falsify A8 **before** any S1
code is written, by hand-extracting three real sealed goals into the SAEOS-1 §4.3 node
types and §4.2 envelope, and measuring what does not survive.

Per CER-1 this probe is adversarial toward the specification that authorises it, and per
K1 it produces a number before it produces an opinion.

